      "name": "Southern Crispy Fried Chicken",
      "price": "₹620",
      "priceNum": 620,
      "desc": "Juicy chicken coated in a crunchy seasoned crust, double-fried for maximum crispiness. Served with hot honey drizzle and coleslaw.",
